keys.description:
herdr's key names in press order, 1..=32 of them, each 1..=32 chars of
letters, digits, `-`, `+` and `_` (`y`, `enter`, `esc`, `ctrl+c`);
herdr decides which names exist.

fetched_at.description:
ISO-8601 UTC stamp of when the published figures were last fetched
(OAuth: the body's `fetched_at`; third-party: the cache write);
`None` when there is no cache or the body is undated.
